<div class="viz"><svg viewBox="0 0 320 220" aria-hidden="true">
<g id="bars"></g>
<polyline class="line" points="20,170 75,140 130,150 185,100 240,80 300,30"/>
<circle cx="300" cy="30" r="5" fill="#fff"/></svg></div>
</div></header>

<section id="services"><div class="wrap">
<div class="sh rv"><div class="eyebrow">{{ p.sections[0].label }}</div><h2>{{ p.sections[0].heading }}</h2><h3>{{ p.sections[0].subheading }}</h3>
<p>I focus on building effective digital marketing strategies that help businesses improve their online presence, reach the right audience, and achieve sustainable growth.</p></div>
<div class="grid" id="svc"></div></div></section>

<section class="dark pf"><div class="wrap">
<div class="sh rv pfh"><div class="eyebrow">{{ p.sections[1].label }}</div><h2>{{ p.sections[1].heading }}</h2><p>{{ p.sections[1].text }}</p>
<div class="nj"><span>Not just SEO</span><span>Not just Ads</span><span>Not just Social Media</span><b>One connected process</b></div></div>
<div class="pfw"><div class="loop"><span>Review · Learn · Optimize · Repeat</span></div><div class="pfg"><div class="pfs rv" style="--i:0"><span class="pn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-5-5"/></svg></span><small>01</small><h3>Research &amp; Planning</h3><p>Understand the market, audience, competitors, and business goals.</p></div><div class="pfs rv" style="--i:1"><span class="pn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M15.5 8.5l-2 5-5 2 2-5z"/></svg></span><small>02</small><h3>Strategy Development</h3><p>Choose the right marketing channels and define a clear direction based on business objectives.</p></div><div class="pfs rv" style="--i:2"><span class="pn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M13 2L4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7z"/></svg></span><small>03</small><h3>Execution</h3><p>Implement the right combination of SEO, Google Ads, Meta Ads, content marketing, and social media marketing.</p></div><div class="pfs rv" style="--i:3"><span class="pn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><small>04</small><h3>Analysis &amp; Optimization</h3><p>Measure performance, analyze data, identify gaps, and optimize marketing activities.</p></div><div class="pfs last rv" style="--i:4"><span class="pn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 11a8 8 0 00-14-4L4 9M4 4v5h5M4 13a8 8 0 0014 4l2-2M20 20v-5h-5"/></svg></span><small>05</small><h3>Continuous Growth</h3><p>Review, learn, optimize, and repeat to build a stronger and more sustainable digital presence.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="alt"><div class="wrap">
<div class="sh rv"><div class="eyebrow">{{ p.sections[2].label }}</div><h2>{{ p.sections[2].heading }}</h2><p>{{ p.sections[2].text }}</p></div>
<div class="mq rv"><div class="mq-track" id="tech"></div></div></div></section>

<section id="about" class="dark about"><div class="wrap">
<div class="sh rv"><div class="eyebrow">{{ p.sections[3].label }}</div><h2>{{ p.sections[3].heading }}</h2><h3>{{ p.sections[3].subheading }}</h3>
<p>Every experience, learning opportunity, and milestone has contributed to my journey in the digital world. Here’s a look at my professional experience and educational background.</p><a class="btn" href="/about.html" style="margin-top:24px">View more</a></div>
<!-- Year for the Wolfable internship is pending final confirmation: edit the date text of item 2 below -->
<div class="tm rv">
<div class="it"><div class="d">March 2026 – October 2026</div><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M9 7V5h6v2"/></svg></span><div><h3>Digital Marketer</h3><p>Purple Phase Communications</p></div></div>
<div class="it"><div class="d">November – February</div><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c1-4 4-6 8-6s7 2 8 6"/></svg></span><div><h3>Digital Marketing Intern</h3><p>Wolfable</p></div></div>
<div class="it"><div class="d">June – October 2025</div><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M8 20h8M12 16v4"/></svg></span><div><h3>Digital Marketing Course</h3><p>IIEDM Ahmedabad</p></div></div>
<div class="it"><div class="d">2022 – 2025</div><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2 9l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/><path d="M6 11v5c3 2 9 2 12 0v-5"/></svg></span><div><h3>Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)</h3><p>Kutch University</p></div></div>
<div class="it"><div class="d">2022</div><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 6c-2-1.5-5-2-8-2v14c3 0 6 .5 8 2 2-1.5 5-2 8-2V4c-3 0-6 .5-8 2zM12 6v14"/></svg></span><div><h3>Higher Secondary Education</h3><p>S.K.R.M School</p></div></div>
<div class="it"><div class="d">Primary &amp; Secondary</div><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 21h18M5 21V9l7-5 7 5v12M10 21v-6h4v6"/></svg></span><div><h3>Schooling</h3><p>Archana St. Xaviers High School, Mandvi</p></div></div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="alt" id="portfolio"><div class="wrap"><div class="sh rv"><h2>{{ p.sections[4].heading }}</h2><p>{{ p.sections[4].text }}</p><a class="btn" href="/portfolio.html" style="margin-top:22px">View Portfolio</a></div></div></section>
<section id="why"><div class="wrap wy"><div class="wl"><div class="sh rv"><div class="eyebrow">{{ p.sections[5].label }}</div><h2>{{ p.sections[5].heading }}</h2><h3>{{ p.sections[5].subheading }}</h3><p>{{ p.sections[5].text }}</p></div><div class="fg"><article class="feat rv"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M15.5 8.5l-2 5-5 2 2-5z"/></svg></span><h3>Customized Marketing Strategies</h3><p>Every business has different goals. I focus on creating marketing strategies that match your business needs, target audience, and industry.</p></article><article class="feat rv"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><h3>Data-Driven Approach</h3><p>I use analytics, research, and performance insights to make informed marketing decisions and identify opportunities for improvement.</p></article><article class="feat rv"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 4h18l-7 8v7l-4 2v-9z"/></svg></span><h3>Focus on Quality Leads</h3><p>The goal is not just to increase website traffic or social media reach, but to attract the right audience and create meaningful business opportunities.</p></article><article class="feat rv"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l9 5-9 5-9-5z"/><path d="M3 13l9 5 9-5"/></svg></span><h3>Multiple Digital Marketing Skills</h3><p>From SEO and Google Ads to Meta Ads, social media marketing, and website development, I bring different digital marketing skills together.</p></article></div></div><figure class="wi rv"><img src="{{ site.photo_home }}" alt="Aayush Doshi working on a laptop" width="720" height="900" loading="lazy"></figure></div></section>
<section class="alt" id="blogs"><div class="wrap"><div class="sh rv"><div class="eyebrow">Blog</div><h2>Latest Insights</h2><p>Articles on SEO, ads and content marketing.</p></div>
{% if collections.posts.length %}<div class="bgrid">{% for post in collections.posts | head(3) %}<a class="bcard rv" href="{{ post.url }}">{% if post.data.image %}<img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="{{ post.data.image_alt or post.data.title }}" loading="lazy">{% endif %}<div class="bt"><small>{{ post.date | dateFormat }}</small><h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3><p>{{ post.data.description }}</p><div class="rm">Read more <span>→</span></div></div></a>{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}
<a class="btn" href="/blog/" style="margin-top:28px">View all blogs</a></div></section>
<section id="industries"><div class="wrap"><div class="sh rv"><h2>{{ p.sections[7].heading }}</h2><p>{{ p.sections[7].text }}</p></div><div class="rv"><a class="pill" href="/healthcare.html">Healthcare</a><a class="pill" href="/manufacturing.html">Manufacturing</a><a class="pill" href="/food.html">Food</a></div></div></section>
<section class="dark ct" id="contact"><div class="wrap">
<div class="sh rv"><div class="eyebrow">{{ p.sections[8].label }}</div><h2>{{ p.sections[8].heading }}</h2><h3 style="color:#d0d0d0">{{ p.sections[8].subheading }}</h3><p>{{ p.sections[8].text }}</p>
<div class="em">Or email directly: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" class="mail">{{ site.email }}</a></div></div>
<form class="cf rv" id="cf">
<div><label for="n">NAME</label><input id="n" name="n" required autocomplete="name"></div>
<div><label for="e">EMAIL</label><input id="e" name="e" type="email" required autocomplete="email"></div>
<div><label for="p">PHONE (OPTIONAL)</label><input id="p" name="p" type="tel" autocomplete="tel"></div>
<div><label for="s">SERVICE NEEDED</label><select id="s" name="s"><option>Search Engine Optimization (SEO)</option><option>Google Ads</option><option>Meta Ads</option><option>Social Media Marketing</option><option>Content Marketing</option><option>E-commerce Marketing</option><option>Local SEO</option><option>Website Development</option><option>Other</option></select></div>
<div class="full"><label for="m">MESSAGE</label><textarea id="m" name="m" required></textarea></div>
<div class="full"><button class="btn" type="submit">Send Message</button><p class="cs" id="cs" role="status"></p></div>
</form></div></section>
{% include "footer.njk" %}

<script>
const S=[["Search Engine Optimization (SEO)","Improve search visibility, attract organic traffic, and connect your website with the right audience through effective SEO strategies.",'<circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-5-5"/>'],
["Google Ads","Reach potential customers through targeted Google advertising campaigns designed to generate leads, traffic, and conversions.",'<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 3v3M12 18v3"/>'],
["Meta Ads","Connect with the right audience through strategic Facebook and Instagram advertising campaigns to build awareness and generate leads.",'<path d="M3 11l14-6v14L3 13z"/><path d="M7 14v5h3l-1-4"/>'],
["Social Media Marketing","Build brand awareness, engage audiences, and strengthen your brand presence across social media platforms.",'<circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="3"/><path d="M9 11l6-4M9 13l6 4"/>'],
["Content Marketing","Create valuable and relevant content that connects with your audience, builds trust, and supports business growth.",'<path d="M4 20l1-5L16 4l4 4L9 19z"/><path d="M14 6l4 4"/>'],
["E-commerce Marketing","Improve online store visibility, attract potential buyers, and create better opportunities for product discovery and sales.",'<path d="M3 4h3l2 12h10l2-8H7"/><circle cx="9" cy="20" r="1"/><circle cx="17" cy="20" r="1"/>'],
["Local SEO","Improve local search presence and help businesses connect with customers looking for nearby products and services.",'<path d="M12 21s7-6 7-12a7 7 0 10-14 0c0 6 7 12 7 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.5"/>'],
["Website Development","Create responsive, user-friendly and SEO-friendly websites that establish a strong digital presence for businesses.",'<path d="M8 8l-5 4 5 4M16 8l5 4-5 4M14 5l-4 14"/>']];
const UU=["seo-services.html", "google-ads.html", "meta-ads.html", "social-media-marketing.html", "content-marketing.html", "ecommerce-marketing.html", "local-seo.html", "website-development.html"];
document.getElementById("svc").innerHTML=S.map((s,i)=>`<div class="card rv"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">${s[2]}</svg><h3>${s[0]}</h3><p>${s[1]}</p>${UU[i]?`<a class="more" href="${UU[i]}">View more <span>→</span></a>`:""}</div>`).join("");
const T=[["WordPress","W","#21759b"],["Wix","Wx","#0c6efc"],["Claude","✻","#d97757"],["ChatGPT","◎","#10a37f"],["Perplexity","P","#20808d"],["Semrush","S","#ff642d"],["Ahrefs","a","#ff7a00"],["Google Tag Manager","T","#4285f4"],["Google Analytics","▮","#e37400"],["Google Search Console","⌕","#34a853"],["Meta Business Suite","M","#0866ff"],["Meta Ads Manager","∞","#0081fb"],["Canva","C","#00c4cc"],["Mailchimp","✉","#e8b400"],["Google Business Profile","G","#ea4335"]];
const tp=T.map(t=>`<div class="tp"><i style="--c:${t[2]}">${t[1]}</i>${t[0]}</div>`).join("");document.getElementById("tech").innerHTML=tp+tp;
document.getElementById("bars").innerHTML=[60,90,75,120,150,185].map((h,i)=>`<rect class="bar" style="animation-delay:${i*.12}s" x="${20+i*53}" y="${210-h*.8}" width="26" height="${h*.8}" opacity=".25"/>`).join("");
const io=new IntersectionObserver(e=>e.forEach(x=>{if(x.isIntersecting){x.target.classList.add("in");io.unobserve(x.target)}}),{threshold:.1});
document.querySelectorAll(".rv").forEach(el=>io.observe(el));
const L=document.getElementById("links");document.getElementById("bg").onclick=()=>L.classList.toggle("open");
L.querySelectorAll("a").forEach(a=>a.onclick=()=>L.classList.remove("open"));
const MAIL="{{ site.email }}";
document.querySelectorAll(".mail").forEach(a=>{a.href="mailto:"+MAIL;if(a.textContent.includes("@"))a.textContent=MAIL});
document.getElementById("cf").addEventListener("submit",ev=>{ev.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(ev.target),g=k=>f.get(k)||"-";
const body=`Name: ${g("n")}\nEmail: ${g("e")}\nPhone: ${g("p")}\nService: ${g("s")}\n\n${g("m")}`;
const a=document.createElement("a");a.href="mailto:"+MAIL+"?subject="+encodeURIComponent("Enquiry from "+g("n"))+"&body="+encodeURIComponent(body);document.body.appendChild(a);a.click();a.remove();
document.getElementById("cs").textContent="Opening your email app… if nothing opens, please write to "+MAIL+"."});
const DD=[...document.querySelectorAll(".dd")],cl=()=>DD.forEach(d=>{d.classList.remove("open");d.querySelector(".ddb").setAttribute("aria-expanded","false")});
DD.forEach(d=>{const b=d.querySelector(".ddb");b.addEventListener("click",e=>{e.stopPropagation();const o=!d.classList.contains("open");cl();if(o){d.classList.add("open");b.setAttribute("aria-expanded","true")}})});
document.addEventListener("click",cl);document.addEventListener("keydown",e=>{if(e.key==="Escape")cl()});
document.querySelectorAll(".subb").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",e=>{e.stopPropagation();const s=b.parentElement,o=s.classList.toggle("open");b.setAttribute("aria-expanded",o)}));
document.addEventListener("click",()=>document.querySelectorAll(".sub.open").forEach(s=>{s.classList.remove("open");s.querySelector(".subb").setAttribute("aria-expanded","false")}));
</script></body></html>
